OL,3,GNEWSAGun row councillor 'should seek
OL,4,Anew vote'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Labour Party has said a councillor
OL,7,Fit suspended after he was photographed
OL,8,Fholding a gun should face a by-election
OL,9,Fas he has since defected to the Greens.
OL,11,FTom Bailey, who has been a vocal figure
OL,12,Fon the River Tyne nurdle spill,
OL,13,Fannounced he was joining the Greens on
OL,14,FMonday.
OL,16,FThe Tynemouth ward representative was
OL,17,Fsuspended by Labour in August after an
OL,18,Fimage of him holding a replica firearm
OL,19,Fwas shared in a WhatsApp group.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
