OL,3,GNEWSAGun row councillor 'should seek
OL,4,Anew vote'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Labour Party spokesperson declined to
OL,7,Fsay if all councillors who switch
OL,8,Fparties should face re-election, but
OL,9,Fsaid: "Councillor Bailey was elected a
OL,10,FLabour councillor and should have the
OL,11,Fcourage of his convictions and call a
OL,12,Fby-election."
